    "type": "game",
    "name": "Station Command",
    "steam_appid": 3542330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new Commander of Gwylio Station, Teleston Industries has given you the job of restoring order to its remote system.\u00a0 The task is difficult, but rest assured your manager has complete confidence in your ability.\u00a0 At least until the next performance review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/0b2e21cb612b28cc9552fad0d812b770.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/b2cafb5f33ee9285833a80c69ddf8db3.poster.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=245 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/b2cafb5f33ee9285833a80c69ddf8db3.webm?t=1748538077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best ships and equipment for each mission you undertake.\u00a0 Learn about your foe's tactics and customize your forces to counter them.\u00a0 Research and develop powerful new weapons and gadgets that will give you the edge out here in the fringes of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/7c9f475ab06dae749723e7e26b7dbc8a.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leader is only as good as the people they command.\u00a0 Manage your bridge crew, working with their conflicting personalities and interests.\u00a0 Build trust, fulfill requests, and uncover what corporate secrets they have learned.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, do remember to check your emails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/d96c8252a6c9f056a76a0c467be018a8.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system isn't going to save itself.\u00a0 Command your fleets in turn based combat as you issue orders from the station.\u00a0 Learn and utilize a wide variety of tactical powers to turn the tide of combat in your favor.\u00a0 As you and your crew become more experienced, evolve your tactical powers to more customized versions that perfectly fit your chosen strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/99323554222c983ac9281454ff868562.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/dc4f4911b026c208330a8644832ae237.poster.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/dc4f4911b026c208330a8644832ae237.webm?t=1748538077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate times call for creative solutions.\u00a0 Salvage every ship you defeat, every piece of equipment they carry, and use them yourself.\u00a0 Rip the cannon out of your nemesis' ship and mount it on your own.\u00a0 Reverse engineer your enemies' technology and build your own better version.\u00a0 The only thing stopping you is copyright protections but they won't enforce those this far out right?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new Commander of Gwylio Station, Teleston Industries has given you the job of restoring order to its remote system.\u00a0 The task is difficult, but rest assured your manager has complete confidence in your ability.\u00a0 At least until the next performance review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/0b2e21cb612b28cc9552fad0d812b770.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/b2cafb5f33ee9285833a80c69ddf8db3.poster.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=245 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/b2cafb5f33ee9285833a80c69ddf8db3.webm?t=1748538077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the best ships and equipment for each mission you undertake.\u00a0 Learn about your foe's tactics and customize your forces to counter them.\u00a0 Research and develop powerful new weapons and gadgets that will give you the edge out here in the fringes of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/7c9f475ab06dae749723e7e26b7dbc8a.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leader is only as good as the people they command.\u00a0 Manage your bridge crew, working with their conflicting personalities and interests.\u00a0 Build trust, fulfill requests, and uncover what corporate secrets they have learned.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, do remember to check your emails.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/d96c8252a6c9f056a76a0c467be018a8.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The system isn't going to save itself.\u00a0 Command your fleets in turn based combat as you issue orders from the station.\u00a0 Learn and utilize a wide variety of tactical powers to turn the tide of combat in your favor.\u00a0 As you and your crew become more experienced, evolve your tactical powers to more customized versions that perfectly fit your chosen strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/99323554222c983ac9281454ff868562.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/dc4f4911b026c208330a8644832ae237.poster.avif?t=1748538077\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542330/extras/dc4f4911b026c208330a8644832ae237.webm?t=1748538077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desperate times call for creative solutions.\u00a0 Salvage every ship you defeat, every piece of equipment they carry, and use them yourself.\u00a0 Rip the cannon out of your nemesis' ship and mount it on your own.\u00a0 Reverse engineer your enemies' technology and build your own better version.\u00a0 The only thing stopping you is copyright protections but they won't enforce those this far out right?</p>",
    "short_description": "As the new Commander of Gwylio Station, it's up to you to save the system from ruin in this sci-fi corporate dystopia. Build your fleet of customized ships. Navigate a setting full of secrets and treachery. Command your ships and salvage everything your enemies leave behind.",
